Output demo/notypo-demo.mp4

Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1000
Set Height 540
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Set Framerate 20
Set Shell "zsh"

Hide
Type "source demo/setup.sh"
Enter
Type "history -c"
Enter
Type "fc -p"
Enter
Ctrl+L
Show
Sleep 1s

Type "git sttus"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "t"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 4s
